-- refusal.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  Route "team" is selected for claude; first run `aigw use --for claude <other-route>`

Impact
  The command could not finish; inspect current state before retrying.

Recommended action
  aigw use --for claude <other-route>
